/-- For [d](hyp:d), [P](hyp:P), [mu](hyp:mu), the iid sampling definition specifies [the stated object](goal). -/
def IidSampling {d n : ℕ} (P : DiscreteLaw d)
    (mu : Measure (Fin n → Obs d)) : Prop := mu = productLaw P n

